  "story": {
    "text": "Walking near Highbury, Harriet is {SURROUNDED} by gipsy children begging, and is too {FRIGHTENED} to run. Frank Churchill comes by and {RESCUES} her. Emma sees a {ROMANCE} at once. Soon Harriet burns her keepsakes of Mr. Elton, and says she {ADMIRES} someone far above her, who did her a great {SERVICE}.",
